    },
    "message": "Run the offline suite in parallel with pytest-xdist\n\nAdd pytest-xdist to the dev dependencies so the suite can run with\n-n auto. On a Ryzen 5 5625U the full run drops from about 12-15 minutes\nto 7-9 minutes; the longest single test (about 6 minutes) sets the floor.\n\nAdd an autouse fixture that points the Project root, XDG state dir and\nLLM cache at a per-test temp dir. Parallel workers then share nothing,\nand tests stop writing to the developer's real locations: a CLI test\nhad been adding a usage account under runs/.projects on every run.\nPaid live_api tests are exempt so their spend still counts against the\nmachine-wide campaign ledger.\n\nAlso fix the editable install command in CONTRIBUTING.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
